00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:26.880
Marukawa publishing glossary!

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.470
Today's term is Emerald Editing Team.

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.580
The Emerald editing team...

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:30.940
...is a team of editors at Marukawa Publishing,

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:33.470
that publishes the monthly shojo manga magazine Emerald.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.990
In the last couple of years, they've boosted their sales a lot,

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:36.680
and are now one of Marukawa
Publishing's main pillars of support.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:37.680
Even though it's a shojo...

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:40.120
...manga editing team, the entire team is made up of guys.
